  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/505704/diamond-spheres-invention-and-ingenuity?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Invention &amp; Ingenuity</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Survivalism sphere, associated 5 ranks.</p>\n<p>If you have the (dredge) package, whenever you successfully damage a creature with a melee attack (or a ranged attack if you have the Expansive Preparation talent), you can dredge a square occupied by the damaged creature as a free action–if the attack was a critical hit or killed the creature, you dredge a 10-foot radius centered on the damaged creature. These dredged squares last for a number of rounds equal to your operative modifier (minimum 1).</p>\n<p>If you have the (harvest) package, whenever you kill a creature, you can harvest it as a free action (as if you had taken 1 minute to do so), and refine one such component as an immediate action. You can also harvest a corpse as a move action.</p>\n<p>If you have the Humane Survivalist talent, you can harvest a component harmlessly from a creature as a standard action or as part of knocking a creature unconscious–if the creature is conscious and unwilling, you can do so with a successful steal combat maneuver or a DC 20 Sleight of Hand check (as if it were a small object). After this action, you can refine such a component as an immediate action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/survivalism#toc67\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
